## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical security and DR design for multi-region RDS deployments, focusing on tenant isolation and key lifecycle.

## Key Concepts

- Aurora Global Database cross-region replication
- AWS KMS per-tenant CMKs and envelope encryption
- Cross-region key material replication and rotation
- DR drills, RPO/RTO verification, latency impact

